                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00478/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把高约0.75m的实木椅子，任何<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">人</span>生物坐在其上时均会不可避免的（以头朝下的姿势）摔倒在地。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被永久保存在Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我就不信邪了，██的，我堂堂七尺男儿还坐不上去一把椅子？——Dr.4826<br />
兄弟们，你们要是想我就多来医院看看我，哎呦&#8230;我的脑袋&#8230;——Dr.4826<br />
阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴——Dr.4826</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00454" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00454-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285237&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607394792" alt="NGC-4826" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285237)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;">NGC-4826</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1604823683 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Nov 2020 08:21</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个████牌头戴式耳机，在被人用来听歌时，使用者会不自觉地唱出正在听的歌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-██低价值异常物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>I want something just like this～Oh, I want something just like this～</em>——正在使用项目听歌的Dr.pigeon<br />
<em>Oh,I want something just he stop！</em>——被Dr.pigeon的歌声折磨到崩溃的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00221" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00221-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607394792" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590676061 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 14:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00385/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支██牌的麦克风，当使用其演唱歌曲时，无论演唱水平如何使用者周边的人都会声称其“唱得很难听”，但若使用其进行发言等活动则无此异常。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020年8月██日<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███省██市██区██宾馆会议室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被入住该宾馆的特工发现并收容，现封存于Site-CN-53低价值物品收容柜。另外购买了一支型号相同的麦克风代替之<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我不想说话，别来管我。</em>——逆光特工<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-174589-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-174589-1')">1</a></sup><br />
<em>逆光恐怕最不想听的就是“你唱得好烂”这句话了。</em>——研究员Sunny</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00385" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00385" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00385-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/backlight-sh" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5374263); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5374263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607394792" alt="Backlight SH" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5374263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/backlight-sh" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5374263); return false;">Backlight SH</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598870124 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">31 Aug 2020 10:35</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">脚注</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-174589-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-174589-1')">1</a>. 曾有过花了很大精力准备的歌曲被人戏称“唱得好烂”的创伤经历。</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00418/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一辆由卡特彼勒公司生产的双轮压路机，当该项目在非铺装路面行驶时，其驶过的路面将被转变为柏油路面。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市一处道路升级工程建筑工地<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-03载具调配场<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>申请使用该项目用于在紧急情况下抢修Site-CN-03的机场跑道。——Dr.Jackson<br />
请求批准——站点主管██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00418" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00418" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00418-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607394792" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601557931 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">01 Oct 2020 13:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00194/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>項鉬媌述：</strong>壹(1)支嘿銫圓銖筆。鉂砽項鉬書瀉の傼茡，以忣媌述垓項鉬の傼茡嘟鱂桧被轉换爲煋芠。Letters except Chinese characters will not be affected.<br />
<strong>迴収ㄖ期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>迴収地點：</strong>深zんeи鈰████汏㙾<br />
<strong>當椾狀態：</strong>被収容玗Site-CN-██低價ィ直粅ρiη収容匮。</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00194" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00194" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00194-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6439634&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607394792" alt="Coldmist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6439634)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;">Coldmist</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589353886 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">13 May 2020 07:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00421/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一本名为███新高中英语词汇的工具书，其异常表现为会使试图背诵其内单词者总是停留在第一页。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███师范大学附属中学某班级。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Area-CN-15的低价值异常物品储藏室内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>abandon，遗弃&#8230;&#8230;-某学生</em><br />
<em>都两个月了你为什么还在背第一页？！！-外勤特工王█<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-556536-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-556536-1')">1</a></sup></em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00421" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00421" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
